# No changelog entry / version bump: documentation-only correction. The 6.2.0
# OVPHYSX entry claimed OvPhysxFrameView's ``set_world_poses`` /
# ``set_local_poses`` emit a one-time ``DeprecationWarning``, and that
# ``get_scales`` / ``set_scales`` are deprecated and warn. Neither was ever
# true -- no released view has ever emitted a DeprecationWarning. All four
# remain supported; the entry now records the preferred space-explicit APIs as
# a note. No OVPhysX code changed.
